  "name": "Quantum Rosetta (QRosetta): A Reproducible Microservice Platform for Cross-Simulator Benchmarking and Agreement Analysis",
  "description": "QRosetta is a microservice platform for running one OpenQASM 2.0 circuit across heterogeneous quantum simulator backends and comparing their resource use, endpoint semantics, raw outputs, and pairwise agreement under a common runner contract.",
